<title>INDIA: India's Reliance up 3 pct on bonus news.</title>
<headline>India's Reliance up 3 pct on bonus news.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of India's largest private sector firm Reliance Industries rose 9.50 rupees, or three percent to 330.50 at the Bombay bourse on Thursday after sources close to the company said it would meet for a bonus share issue on June 26.</p>
